cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Object Intensity Profiling"
abstract: >-
  ImageJ/Fiji plugin for measuring where raw signal lies inside each object in a
  label image. Provides fixed-length radial, image-axis, principal-axis, angular
  and shell profiles, per-object cross-channel correlation, and optional texture
  measurements. The label image supplies object geometry only.
